summary:
CFOSWAP is a decentralized trading protocol deployed on BNB Smart Chain (BSC), and the world's first platform to integrate trade mining into a DEX aggregation router. Every swap you make on CFOSWAP automatically joins the mining program and earns CFO rewards based on trading volume — trading is mining, with no staking or locking required.

Aggregated routing: automatically compares PancakeSwap V2 / V3 and other liquidity pools to pick the best execution path for every swap;
Trade mining: trading volume involving stablecoins is converted at USD value, and CFO rewards are issued automatically;
Reward vesting: rewards vest linearly over 365 days to curb short-term sell pressure; the day-one increment can be claimed immediately;
On-chain verifiable: all mechanisms and parameters follow the deployed contracts and can be verified by anyone on-chain.
